{"title":"Mock AIME 6 2006-2007 Problems/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_6_2006-2007_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Draw in the diagonals of a regular octagon.  What is the sum of all distinct angle measures, in degrees, formed by the intersections of the diagonals in the interior of the octagon?\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_6_2006-2007_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Each diagonal will have an angle with the horizontal base of the octagon as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/7/1776c08b9e5642ccd66573bd4b933d401456e4ac.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$22.5^\\circ k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"52\" height=\"15\" /> where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/c/5/3c5182b7797d66fba8a2438ed1138c30f2c0839f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k=0,1,\\cdots 7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"104\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>When a diagonal with angle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/7/1776c08b9e5642ccd66573bd4b933d401456e4ac.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$22.5^\\circ k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"52\" height=\"15\" /> intersects with another diagonal with different angle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/a/e/2aed5f0c898eeab54241080f8809e32adb1f949d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$22.5^\\circ m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"58\" height=\"15\" /> where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/f/b1ffa147529c5011ac3b1b45d3bf44623c2cc3ed.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m&gt;k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"52\" height=\"15\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/3/ee37ca4a7b279f87be9168732e3ae7d9bdbdfa32.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m=1,2 \\cdots 7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"105\" height=\"17\" /> then the angle of the intersection is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/3/f331b32f9b6df9f19dfd0b52e9df13e6d2dc94db.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$22.5^\\circ (m-k)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"104\" height=\"20\" />  Since all of the unique values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/2/0/720aea377c6d8cd17fc30c0e55c516257d754e60.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(m-k)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"64\" height=\"20\" /> will be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/d/1/0d10cc3ea5ed14f769acd42e68969baca9ffcd06.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1,2,3,\\cdots 7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"87\" height=\"17\" />, then let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/d/1/6d1ad3734ab8f7a8c0a760db1aa13e2600586177.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n=1,2,3,\\cdots 7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"122\" height=\"17\" /> and the sum of all distinct angle measures will be given by:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/7/9/879a9b700fd5c9d28031c96d4acdf307c31d85b0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S=\\sum_{n=1}^{7}22.5^\\circ n=22.5^\\circ\\sum_{n=1}^{7} n=22.5^\\circ \\frac{7 \\times 8}{2}=22.5^\\circ \\times 28 = \\boxed{630}^{\\;\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -23px\" width=\"512\" height=\"55\" />\n</p><p>~Tomas Diaz. orders@tomasdiaz.com\n</p><p><i>Alternate solutions are always welcome. If you have a different, elegant solution to this problem, please <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_6_2006-2007_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit\">add it</a> to this page.</i>\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018040613\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.012 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.023 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 43/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 383/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2129/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    5.642      1 Template:Alternate_solutions\n100.00%    5.642      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:25874:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018040613 and revision id 205940. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}